2139		Lemma~\ref{lem:qld-4-13-established} supplies measurements on the directly
2140		indexed line carrier: an axis line records its base point and directly sampled
2141		coordinate index, while a diagonal line also records a direction whose earlier
2142		coordinates vanish. Its averages use the corresponding
2143		directly indexed line-point law, and its consistency relations use the completed
2144		answer alphabet $\F_q \cup \{\bot\}$. These data are not yet a strategy for the
2145		classical low individual degree game of Definition~\ref{def:ld-game}, whose line
2146		questions retain a field-valued seed. Such a strategy requires a transport from
